  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Young people are leaders of change in Iraq</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Establishing a center in Iraq to rehabilitate and educate young people in an interactive and applied manner, and education methods focus on building mental, emotional, spiritual and economic capacities and rejecting violence and extremism. The curriculum aims to teach youth entrepreneurship skills - financial skills - life skills, personal characteristics, and renounce violence and extremism. Young people can overcome the trauma of war and violence and help them discover opportunities for growth</narrative>
  </description>
